 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Walking in the light as He is in the light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fellowship with one another shines",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No more lying when the truth is near",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We do not practice what is clear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If we claim no sin we deceive ourselves",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The truth is missing from our lives",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But in the dark we cannot stay",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We must turn and find the way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If we confess our sins",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is faithful and just",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He will forgive our sins",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And cleanse us as we trust",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From all unrighteousness",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His love never ends",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faithful and just",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying we have sinned makes Him a liar",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His word is not in us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But when we speak the truth we find",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A heart that is kind and blind",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To no confession that is real",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His grace is pure and steel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The blood of Jesus cleanses us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From all sin and all abuse",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
